<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia details April trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Indonesia details April trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a breakdown of Indonesia's trade figures in April, as announced by Information Minister Hartono on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figures are in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>				April	 March	April 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance	  +590.5     +243.3	+366.2</p>
<p>    Exports		 4,153.5    4,064.5     4,010.8</p>
<p>    Imports		 3,563.0    3,821.2     3,644.6</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports	 968.5	960.9	 939.2</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
